    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Enchanting Presence.</strong> You always have @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCharmPerso]{Charm Person} prepared. You can cast it without a spell slot, and you must finish a Long Rest before you can cast it this way again; you can also cast it with spell slots of the appropriate level you have. Its spellcasting ability is the ability increased by this feat.</p><p><strong>Inevitable Betrayal.</strong> You have Advantage on attack rolls against creatures that have the &amp;Reference[Charmed] condition.</p>",
